[177.231065, "o", "at position as a forced neighbor.\\n\\nI need to verify the endNode is set to (3,3) instead of (2,2) so the return value comes from the forced neighbor logic rather than reaching the goal. I'm also checking that the upper branch doesn't interfere—the wall is only at (2,1), so (2,3) is walkable and won't trigger the upper condition. sure upper doesn't fire. All cells are walkable except (2,1), so (2,3) is walkable, which means the upper branch condition fails and only the lower branch executes as expected. Now I'm setting up the second test case for the vertical forced right side movement, checking the conditions when moving down from (2,1) to (2,2) with a wall positioned to trigger the diagonal jump logic. I'm verifying the left branch doesn't fire when the right branch does by checking that (3,2) is walkable. Now I'm setting up test 4, which checks the horizontal movement case where moving right from (1,2) to (2,2) with a wall at (2,1) should trigger the forced lower branch. Now I'm testing the case where a "]
[177.231076, "o", "node moves right with a wall directly above it—the diagonal neighbor at (3,3) should be added since the upper cell is blocked. I'm also setting up the next test for when the wall is below instead.\\n\\nThen there's a vertical movement case where the node moves down from (2,1) to (2,2) with a wall to the right, which should force the diagonal neighbor at (3,3) to be included in the results.\\n\\nFor the next scenario, I'm checking when that same vertical movement has a wall to the left instead—the algorithm should then push the diagonal neighbor at (1,3).\\n\\nFinally, I'm starting to look at how the JPFMoveDiagonallyIfAtMostOneObstacle variant handles this, where moving down from (2,1) to (2,2) should add the direct vertical neighbor at (2,3) to the list. Writing test cases... , there are no pairs, so it should return [[2,2]] or an empty array. Let me verify by checking the expandPath implementation to see what happens with a single-node input.\",\"signature\":\"EstDClsIDBgCKkBNtvCFh9A75m3PbZPwnUZrTm4yOWu0E3u1dTr7h"]
